    "sub_name": "全球定位系統",
    "sub_ename": "GLOBAL POSITIONING SYSTEM",
    "describe_ch": "GPS為全球衛星導航系統(Global Navigation Satellite System)其中之一，為目前最被普遍使用之衛星定位系統。課程內容包含GNSS各衛星系統概述，訊息種類、儀器、定位數學模式、誤差來源、資料處理、品質管制及未來技術與系統整合等。",
    "describe_eh": "GPS is one of the global navigation satellite system, and the most widely used satellite positioning system. Course content includes an overview of GNSS satellite systems, message types, instruments, positioning the mathematical model, error sources, data processing, quality control and future technologies and systems integration.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
